  triage:title "boundaries/atm-daemon/socket-server-transport.toml has no record for local_tcp_transport" ;
  triage:description "No mechanical lint rule catches a crate binding both the UDS and HTTP-loopback local transports for the same ingress role -- lint_boundaries.py has nothing to flag here. Companion to AI14-QA1-RBQA-F001 (the actual dual-listener defect); should land alongside that fix as an update to boundaries/atm-daemon/socket-server-transport.toml adding a canonical single-local-receive-path rule." ;
